    "description": "Decide whether to post this cycle-count adjustment. Post only if the referenced count sheet exists and was taken for this bin and this SKU by an authorized counter. Counted stock on the sheet EXCLUDES units already staged against open reservations, so the adjustment is counted_units - (system_quantity - open_reservations). The proposed delta must equal that value exactly, and an unreviewed posting may not exceed the absolute review cap. Post any valid count that is proposed; otherwise escalate for supervisor review. Do not edit the proposal. Synthetic warehouse policy."
